    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "subject": "=Let's talk today — we can help {{ $json.company }}",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<html>\n<body style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #e74c3c;\">🔥 Let's Connect Today</h2>\n  <p>Hi <strong>{{ $json.name }}</strong>,</p>\n  <p>Thank you for reaching out! Based on what you've shared, I can see a clear fit between your needs at <strong>{{ $json.company }}</strong> and what we offer.</p>\n  <p>I want to connect with you <strong>today</strong> — we help companies like yours achieve results fast, and I don't want you to wait.</p>\n  <p><strong>Here's what I propose:</strong></p>\n  <ul>\n    <li>✅ A 30-minute same-day discovery call</li>\n    <li>✅ A custom solution overview tailored to {{ $json.company }}</li>\n    <li>✅ Clear next steps and pricing within 24 hours</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p style=\"margin: 30px 0;\">\n    <a href=\"https://calendly.com/yourlink\" style=\"background: #e74c3c; color: white; padding: 14px 28px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold;\">Book a Same-Day Call →</a>\n  </p>\n  <p>Can't wait? Reply to this email and I'll respond within the hour.</p>\n  <p>Best,<br><strong>Your Name</strong><br>Founder @ Your Company</p>\n  <hr style=\"border: none; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-top: 30px;\">\n  <p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #999;\">You received this because you submitted a form on our website.</p>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
