        "subject": "=Great to hear from you, {{ $json.name }}",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<html>\n<body style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #3498db;\">Thanks for Getting in Touch!</h2>\n  <p>Hi <strong>{{ $json.name }}</strong>,</p>\n  <p>It's great to hear from you! I reviewed your message and I'd love to explore how we can help <strong>{{ $json.company }}</strong>.</p>\n  <p>Many companies in your space find that automating the right processes saves 10+ hours per week. I'd love to show you what that could look like for you.</p>\n  <p><strong>Let's set up a quick call this week:</strong></p>\n  <ul>\n    <li>🎯 I'll understand your specific challenges at {{ $json.company }}</li>\n    <li>📊 Share relevant case studies from similar companies</li>\n    <li>💡 Give you 2-3 actionable ideas you can use immediately</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p style=\"margin: 30px 0;\">\n    <a href=\"https://calendly.com/yourlink\" style=\"background: #3498db; color: white; padding: 14px 28px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold;\">Schedule a Call This Week →</a>\n  </p>\n  <p>Looking forward to connecting!</p>\n  <p>Best,<br><strong>Your Name</strong><br>Founder @ Your Company</p>\n  <hr style=\"border: none; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-top: 30px;\">\n  <p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #999;\">You received this because you submitted a form on our website.</p>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "options": {
