        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<html>\n<body style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #27ae60;\">Thanks for Your Message!</h2>\n  <p>Hi <strong>{{ $json.name }}</strong>,</p>\n  <p>Thank you for reaching out! We appreciate your interest, and I wanted to make sure you have some helpful resources to get started.</p>\n  <p>Here are a few things that might be useful for you:</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li>📖 <a href=\"https://yourblog.com/ai-automation-guide\">Free Guide: Getting Started with AI Automation</a></li>\n    <li>🎥 <a href=\"https://youtube.com/yourvideolink\">Video: How AI Can Transform Your Business in 2026</a></li>\n    <li>💼 <a href=\"https://yourwebsite.com/case-studies\">Case Studies: Real Results from Our Clients</a></li>\n  </ul>\n  <p>When you're ready to explore further, I'm here. Feel free to reply to this email anytime or book a call when the time is right.</p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 30px 0;\">\n    <a href=\"https://calendly.com/yourlink\" style=\"background: #27ae60; color: white; padding: 14px 28px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold;\">Book a Free Intro Call →</a>\n  </p>\n  <p>No pressure — we'll be here when you're ready.</p>\n  <p>Best,<br><strong>Your Name</strong><br>Founder @ Your Company</p>\n  <hr style=\"border: none; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-top: 30px;\">\n  <p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #999;\">You received this because you submitted a form on our website.</p>\n</body>\n</html>",
